WEBVTT

00:01:27.333 --> 00:01:30.586
Most people don't see us
as philanthropists

00:01:30.628 --> 00:01:32.213
or this process

00:01:32.255 --> 00:01:34.173
when they think of philanthropy.

00:01:34.173 --> 00:01:37.135
But I'm here to show you
the powerful possibility

00:01:37.176 --> 00:01:40.471
that exists in all of us
to be philanthropists,

00:01:40.513 --> 00:01:42.974
no matter your age or your wealth,

00:01:42.974 --> 00:01:45.393
no matter where you live
or where you come from.

00:01:46.394 --> 00:01:49.188
I am originally from Mexico City,

00:01:49.188 --> 00:01:51.941
moved to the US 25 years ago,

00:01:51.983 --> 00:01:56.070
and in 2007, when I started
my first giving circle,

00:01:56.112 --> 00:01:58.698
I didn't even know the concept had a name.

00:01:58.739 --> 00:01:59.991
This is not new.